{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01577","headline":"琴曲歌辞 胡笳十八拍 第十一拍 · 刘商","name":"琴曲歌辞 胡笳十八拍 第十一拍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日来月往相推迁，迢迢星岁欲周天。\n无冬无夏卧霜霰，水冻草枯爲一年。\n汉家甲子有正朔，绝域三光空自悬。\n几回鸿雁来又去，肠断蟾蜍亏复圆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘商","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01577.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01577","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}